  "details": "When someone is typing a chatbox message, the typing indicator disappears after a few seconds even when they are still typing.\n\n**Steps to reproduce**\n\n- Open 2 clients or get a friend\n\n- Have one user begin typing into the chatbox continuously\n\n- Notice that from the POV of remote users, the overhead typing indicator always disappears after about 5 seconds.\n\n**Notes**\n\n- The typing indicator does not return under any circumstance until the entirety of the chatbox's input field is cleared, in which the typing indicator will return for another 5 seconds before disappearing again.\n\n- This issue started occurring very recently but is present on both Live and Open Beta. (Both from the perspective of the sender and the people viewing the indicator.)",
